{"id":"vod_md_6251","vodId":"6251","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"妄想学生会2","name_cn":"妄想学生会2","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231024-1/6dab15f5ab0b1ebe81ba1243a80fc609.jpg"},"summary":"私立樱才学园本是一所女子高校，然而，在社会大趋势的冲击之下，校方决定打开大门，迎接男生们的到来。第一年，学校录取的男生仅有区区二十八人，他们所要面对的，是泱泱五百二十四位“如狼似虎”的女生们。津田隆利（浅沼晋太郎 配音）就是这二十八人中的一员，机缘巧合之下，他误打误撞加入了学生会之中。外表端庄秀丽，却有着极大脑洞和极强妄想能力的学生会会长天草筱（日笠阳子 配音）、个性成熟可靠但有时候会语出惊人的七条天空（佐藤聪美 配音）、智商超哥但个性如同小学生一样傲娇的荻村铃（矢作纱友里 配音），在三位古灵精怪的女孩子的陪伴下，津田的校园生活正式拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-24 08:13:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/6wHce9oc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/Nry16uuS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/jM0nD05o/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/0BGFUG7n/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/dLfJt4SP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/p0AXxSWW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/EiSXfT9s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/kWcFyHFk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/JBzuOrxw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/iZSOGGmG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/unulWXRN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/EgbN3vp3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/JXXwPsY6/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:14.143Z"}